  "implementedScope": [
    "Protected native file_read for supported local images and saved screenshots uses existing permissions, source snapshots and one immediate prepared-media continuation; explicit image-as-text remains not_text and OFF semantics remain intact.",
    "UTF-16 OCR intervals use ordered-span binary selection and difference accumulation with bounded cancellation/deadline polling; empty spans, overlapping/unsorted finite hits, category order and four-pixel expansion remain preserved.",
    "Successful retired contract tickets release idempotently; foreign tickets and cleanup uncertainty still refuse.",
    "Detached TTL cleanup obtains a fresh trusted maintenance admission covering the complete remove, physical unlink, source close and scope release; normal stale business continuations still refuse; maintenance/extraAdmission and physical identity guards are unchanged."
  ],
  "qualificationScope": [
    "Responses PDF actual tool-result transport, plus encrypted browser Chat/Responses/Anthropic preview=Send/Steer checks with local synthetic receivers.",
    "Twenty additional Office text/preview cases bring the full document/video matrix to 33 assertions, including XLSX, ODT/ODS, non-ASCII preservation and exact hidden/formula/conditional/external/ODP refusal cases.",
    "A pinned offline generator creates 17 public synthetic image cases across PNG/BMP/JPEG/WebP, independent EXIF mappings and sensitive text/QR/EAN/pixel oracles; generating fixtures does not grant qualification.",
    "Real HTTP cancellation, post-header preview disconnect, physical source/policy changes, real ticket expiry and four successive preparations, each with immediate authenticated preview and unchanged deadline.",
    "Historical 28 unit failures corrected through test seams, exact historical native method locks, isolated-Python probe alignment, explicit config-tier expectations and fresh encrypted-storage census. No behavior assertions were removed.",
    "Two final unit seams aligned with not_text and fixtureRules; exact Chinese-regex line registration and the real-TTL metadata count/exemption aligned without broad allowlists."
  ],
